  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "危ない危ない……\r\n甘奈、ありがとな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012010050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、大丈夫だよ～\r\nこの時期はたまにやっちゃうよね～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201401201/2014012010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だいぶ暖かくなってきたもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012010060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "春もすぐそこって感じだね\r\n桜もちょっとだけ咲いたりしてるし！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401201/2014012010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、本当だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "満開になるのが楽しみだな\r\nここ、すごく綺麗に咲くんだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012010070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そうなんだ！\r\nその頃になったらまた来たいね～",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401201/2014012010070"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、事務所からもそんなに離れてないしな\r\n──っと、そうだそうだ、桜で思い出したことが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈は桜……というか\r\n春に関するエピソードって何かあったりするか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012010080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "え？　どうして？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201401201/2014012010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今度雑誌の企画で甘奈へのインタビューがあってな\r\nその時の質問に『春のトーク』のコーナーがあるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それで、ちょっと聞いておきたくて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012010090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "なるほどね……うーん……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401201/2014012010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012010091,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "じゃあ、桜と甘奈の友達についてのお話、するね",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401201/2014012010091"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012010100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈のうちって転勤族でしょ\r\nだから、このくらいの時期に引っ越すことが多かったの",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401201/2014012010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012010110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "で、そういう時って転校前にお別れ会\r\nしてくれたりすること、あると思うんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401201/2014012010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012010120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "めっちゃ仲良しだった子たちがね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401201/2014012010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012010130,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "桜の押し花を栞にして\r\nプレゼントしてくれたんだ～",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401201/2014012010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、それは素敵な贈り物だな\r\nその栞って今も使ってるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012010140,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "もちろん、ずーっと使ってるよ～！\r\n甘奈の宝物っ☆",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401201/2014012010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それなら、もし甘奈が良ければ\r\n栞の写真、撮ってきてくれないか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "実際に掲載してもらった方が\r\nいい記事になりそうだからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012010150,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うんっ！　了解っ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401201/2014012010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとな、甘奈\r\nきっとインタビュアーさんも喜ぶだろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012010160,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、どういたしましてっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401201/2014012010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012010170,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "じゃあ、今度はプロデューサーさんの番ね～！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401201/2014012010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012010180,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈が春のエピソードを話したんだから\r\nプロデューサーさんも何かどうぞっ☆",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401201/2014012010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えぇ……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "じゃあ出会い\r\nの話なんだけど",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "特にないなぁ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "じゃあ……\r\n公園の桜の話を",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012010190,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うんうん！",
